1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
The moon doesn't compare itself to the stars.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,600
The flowers don't compare themselves to other flowers.

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,260
We shouldn't compare ourselves to anyone else either.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,660
So just be yourself.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,640
Walk your own path quietly,

6
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,420
and life becomes so much easier.
